        <%# ── 1. Agreement ─────────────────────────────────────── %>
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            By accessing or using the DataKeep platform ("Service"), you ("Client," "you," or "your") agree to be bound by these Terms of Service ("Terms"). If you are using the Service on behalf of an organization, you represent that you have authority to bind that organization and "you" refers to both you individually and that organization.
          </p>
