            If you do not agree to these Terms, you must not access or use the Service.
          </p>
        </section>

        <%# ── 2. Service Description ──────────────────────────── %>
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">2. Service Description</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            DataKeep provides a self-service platform that <strong>automates and facilitates</strong> database backup, synchronization, and monitoring operations. The Service connects to database systems that you own or are authorized to access and performs operations on your behalf according to schedules and configurations you define.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2">
            DataKeep is an <strong>automation tool</strong>. We do not host, manage, or administer your databases. We provide the mechanism to schedule, execute, encrypt, store, and restore backups. The integrity, availability, and security of your underlying database infrastructure remain your responsibility.
          </p>
        </section>

        <%# ── 3. "As Is" ─────────────────────────────────────── %>
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">3. Service Provided "As Is"</h2>
          <div class="mt-3 rounded-lg border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 p-4 dark:border-amber-800/50 dark:bg-amber-900/20">
